# Service pattern

```ts
async search(req: Partial<SearchReq> = {}): Promise<Item[]> {
  return await firstValueFrom(
    this.http.post<Item[]>(`${this.baseUrl}/Search`, req),
  );
}
```

- Return `Promise<T>` with `async` / `await` / `firstValueFrom`.
- POST the entity or criteria directly (no `Item` envelope).
- Do not wrap in `try/catch` that only rethrows — let errors reach the screen / HTTP interceptor.
- Screens: `await this.companyService.search({})` then bind.
